se branch, disable matrix fail-fast, add the missing beads [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sidecar to the lint environment, pin keep-sorted, and file beads for the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]two observed flaky tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Build the Rust core once per run[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core-wheel-once[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ci-signal-restore[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-wheel-once: add a build-core root job that builds one abi3 [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sase_core_rs wheel per run, teach the Justfile a SASE_CORE_WHEEL install[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]path, fan the wheel out via artifact and a setup-sase composite action, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and drop the duplicated sase-core rust-check from bead-backend.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Consolidate lanes without losing coverage[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]lane-consolidation[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-wheel-once[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]lane-consolidation: merge the three perf-floor jobs into one, delete the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]redundant install-smoke/bead-backend/build/fmt-md-check jobs after [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]folding their unique steps into neighbors, run the visual suite exactly [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]once per run, build docs once per event, and serialize docs deploys.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Derive the CI sidecar environment from configuration[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]config-driven-sidecars[dim] · [dim][/dim]after lane-consolidation[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]config-driven-sidecars: replace the hand-written sidecar checkouts and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sdd-store heredoc with a tools/ci_bootstrap_sidecars script generated [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]from sase/sase.yml, with unit tests locking the store shape.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-am","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","phase_bead_id":"sase-am.1","reasoning_effort":"medium","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-7ce95243715d7efb25c1a218298c6d33","started_at":"2026-07-28T22:06:48.850761+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"ec7f09aba2045f9ecf36311f928da672242ffbf2497c7a2dec77d4fcec162e44","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-am.land--plan/chat.md","size_bytes":3218},"commits":{"digest":"c95418c5062358f1ff5e3b350a58f0c51ef181d8d03234ade3ef1959269b1059","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-am.land--plan/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-am.land--plan/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"5d1b6f5985621ab5cfba69d0ad1ca78465e823a2e99b8f5aa9ceb17aaa153a28","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-am.land--plan/meta.json","size_bytes":701},"prompt":{"digest":"f33465ca53f258f181ebfa3c439cb8208d5c73c5cf3c487eb5b3e1ef550abcaf","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-am.land--plan/prompt.md","size_bytes":226},"state":{"digest":"667b4462ad2a70ede245bfc15590ddea6027f0b83672bfeefa891231095ea3a2","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-am.land--plan/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-am.land--plan","local_name":"sase-am.land--plan","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-am","agent_clan_generation":"20260728180631","agent_family":"sase-am.land","agent_family_role":"plan","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-am","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-am","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-am.land"},"source_run_id":"